<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Bait &amp; Switch</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">KMFDM</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Blitz</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">2JylxGfaeGAsiLbQC9tYYH</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.690" end="00:44.214">Fear not what the future holds</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.214" end="00:46.901">Rest your weary soul</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.901" end="00:52.298">I'll do the rest</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.298" end="00:58.276">Careful as I gentle down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.276" end="01:01.381">Like a sacred cow</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.381" end="01:09.381">Give you my best</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.136" end="01:23.020">Rest assured</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.020" end="01:24.962">I know you know</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.962" end="01:26.462">Truth is good</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.124" end="01:27.982">To win the goal</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.982" end="01:30.167">There comes a time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.167" end="01:32.091">Fight or flight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.091" end="01:33.591">All behold</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.531" end="01:35.960">The legacy mine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.960" end="01:42.351">Hark the herald angels sing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.351" end="01:49.586">Glory to the king of kings</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.586" end="01:56.865">A better life imagined through his eyes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.865" end="02:04.402">A veil of finely calibrated lies</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.402" end="02:08.018">Bait and switch</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.018" end="02:11.669">One and all full of shit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.669" end="02:13.479">Bait and switch</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.479" end="02:21.479">Everything in time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.637" end="02:25.134">Follow me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.134" end="02:28.879">Down the garden path</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.879" end="02:31.402">Take you by the hand</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.402" end="02:36.962">Lead you astray</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.962" end="02:39.674">Don't look back</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:39.674" end="02:43.301">Leave the past behind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:43.301" end="02:46.271">Let bygones be gone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:46.271" end="02:54.271">Live for today</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:05.787" end="03:07.300">In control</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:07.300" end="03:08.986">Make no mistake</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:08.986" end="03:12.948">The world is mine alone to take</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:12.948" end="03:15.015">All for for one</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:15.015" end="03:16.515">One for none</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:16.229" end="03:18.281">In god we trust</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:18.281" end="03:21.407">To seal our fate</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:21.407" end="03:27.480">Hark the herald angels sing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:27.480" end="03:34.480">Glory to the king of kings</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:34.480" end="03:41.722">A better life imagined through his eyes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:41.722" end="03:48.976">A veil of finely calibrated lies</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:48.976" end="03:52.591">Bait and switch</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:52.591" end="03:56.381">One and all full of shit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:56.381" end="03:57.986">Bait and switch</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:57.986" end="04:05.986">Everything in time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:18.955" end="04:25.177">Hark the herald angels sing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:25.177" end="04:32.343">Glory to the king of kings</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:32.343" end="04:39.600">A better life imagined through his eyes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:39.600" end="04:46.839">A veil of finely calibrated lies</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:46.839" end="04:50.360">Bait and switch</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:50.360" end="04:54.157">One and all full of shit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:54.157" end="04:55.708">Bait and switch</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:55.708" end="04:59.708">Everything in time</p></div></body></tt>